  "description": {
    "text": "Collection Sheet Journey Partners, released on 18 September 2010, the same day as the games Pokémon Black and White. It was the first product of the Pokémon Card Game BW series and brought the Pokémon of the Unova region into the card game for the first time. It came as three sheets named for the Unova starters, Snivy, Tepig and Oshawott, each holding three fixed holo cards: its starter and two other Unova Pokémon. Together the three sheets covered all nine types of the time.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "Pokémon Card Game official site, archived: コレクションシート 旅立ちの仲間 ツタージャ・ポカブ・ミジュマル",
        "url": "https://web.archive.org/web/20100920192107/http://www.pokemon-card.com/products/bw/cs1.html"
      },
      {
        "title": "Wikipedia (Japanese): ポケモンカードゲームの発売タイトル一覧",
        "url": "https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%83%9D%E3%82%B1%E3%83%A2%E3%83%B3%E3%82%AB%E3%83%BC%E3%83%89%E3%82%B2%E3%83%BC%E3%83%A0%E3%81%AE%E7%99%BA%E5%A3%B2%E3%82%BF%E3%82%A4%E3%83%88%E3%83%AB%E4%B8%80%E8%A6%A7"
      }
    ]
  },
